{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1008283-to-all-people-who-say-magic-doesn-t-happen-d","id":1008283,"title":"To all people who say magic doesn't happen :D","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-25T14:56:50-08:00","id":1008283,"title":"To all people who say magic doesn't happen :D","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">so basically thats what happened at my table in the last week or so <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I was building the character with my girlfriend since she wanted to roleplay and try mage (!!) for the first time! yay!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I was telling her about spheres, the world of darkness, the philosophy of mage and the basica of roleplayng when\u2026.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Her friend (she is a roommate of her) who was quietly sitting in the living room, was actually listening to us.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">At some point, while i was explaining my girlfriend how to distribute the attributes and ability points, she joined in in the creation of my girlfriends wizard!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">it was sooo funny to watch them argue about which skill should be primary or if strength was better than intelligence or perception <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> or which powers she should have\u2026</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">about 1 hour later( yep, that took long) we finished her character\u2026 and i could see my girlfriend\u2019s roommate eyes were glowing with interest and questions!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So i told her\u2026 \u201chey, are u sure you don\u2019t wanna try it out?\u201d</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">She screamed and was so happy about it we started to work right away into her character.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">By the time we were done, it was dinner time so i stayed for dinner.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">(Since i\u2019m a veteran Dungeon master/Vampire and Werewolf player , and a newbie mage the ascension storyteller, my mind was already working on a story and a game session <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )))</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So while we were eating pizza, i quietly asked \u201cDo u girls wanna try your characters? Why don\u2019t we play a little Mage the ascension?\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They were super excited and we started playing. We agreed on play as humans on their first game session, and role-play their awakening as mages. We did and it was awesome! I admit it, i was a little bit of an asshole. i had them meet two nephandi as their first mages :P and they tried to recruit them since they saw some potential in these girls, and the chance of awakening. when the girls found out how the true nature of these \u201cwizards\u201d was (and their hidden corpses used as focus for rituals) they awakened and fought back with primitive powers they couldn't control and paradox).</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">When paradox and magic happened, other traditions mages tracked them down and taught them about magic and being wizards, traditions and technocracy.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Now, a thing i didn't mention was that during our game sessions, there was <i>another girl </i>watching!!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">It was my girlfriend\u2019s second roomate.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I was fearing we would bore her to death, or that she might find us nerds and \u201closers\u201d who were doing weird stuff in her kitchen!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">To my surprise, she looked genuinely interested in what was happening and she soon forgot the tablet she was holding.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">She laughed and got scared while the new \u201cwitches\u201d were facing off spirits or weird events, and would comment on the things happening during the game. She also made good very good guesses and connections to seemingly random events that got tied together during the session. (mage style)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Long story short, after our first session that ended with the awakening and meeting of new mentors, (the nefandi fought a little against traditions mages and then escaped), i asked her if she would like to join us next time!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">She replied smiling \u201cof course!! i love magic and harry potter! And i like what u guys are doing\u201d</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">All three of them looked so excited and interested i couldn't believe my eyes.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They were pressing me days and days with questions on powers, factions, plot, the story\u2026 \u201cWhat will happen next?? Who were those bad mages?\u201d \u201care there vampires too? What about werewolves??\u201d \u201care our mentors strong?? Will they teach us cool magic?\u201d</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">classic newbie questions XD \u201cWhich one is strongest? vampire, mage or wolf???\u201d \u201cWhy hasn\u2019t the technocracy already won? They are the strongest!!!\u201d \u201cWhich sphere is the strongest one?? i want the strongest\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They built their characters according to their concept, nature and demeanor. They planned their families, background and history very carefully. Lovers, friends etc\u2026</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Since that night we have been playing for 5 game sessions. Now another friend of mine joined in (another woman!!) she is an old nerd gamer friend of mine, and she already played mage the awaekning.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So long story short, to some it up- yep. I\u2019m a male storyteller and i have <i>an entire cabal of witches </i>playing with me!!!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">4 witches!!!</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So far they fought against the nephandi and had to escape the grip of cruel technocrats who wanted to enslave them and erase their memories. They met their mentors and had magic classes and practical training.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They learned about vulgar and coincidental magic, and suffered little paradoxes.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They saw what work or doesn't work in combat, and how rituals work.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They realized that mages are stronger when they are prepared and have time to cast.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They were able to kill 3 nefandi and made one get arrested and sentenced to jail.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They fought against a fomori and learned about the paradox free Umbra .</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">The group is composed by my girlfiend- an artist dream speaker who uses her paint and drawing and art as a focus (she paint spirits and visions and they happen or manifest) she employ spirit and matter and life, she is an \u201cartist\u201d inspired by the spirit voices, and can modify as art the body the spirits and the matter</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">My gf first roommate- a warrior Verbena who uses norse mythology and magic as focus, and runes. She is a flower and gardener expert, and she uses also plant as focus for life, while she employ runes for forces, and she also uses Prime</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">My girlfriend 2 roomate- Order of hermes nerd and librarian, she loves ancient languages and riddle, top university student - she studies the art of Forces, mind and prime</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">My old nerd friend , Order of hermes- house quaesitor- a sneaky and cynic mage with ruthless thirst for power- a perfect inquisitor for the order of hermes, in the mortal world an agent for the IRS. Mind, correspondence and matter.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So to sum it up.- it ws amazing, how it all started and how it keeps going.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">They were able to track down the nefandi cabal and almost killed them ambushing them during a ritual.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Now they can try to seize the old nefandi nest (which will not be easy at all since the resonance and the spirits who live there) and try to have a small node (there is one inside the building).They will have to work hard against wyrm spirits and maybe even vampires\u2026 (the old den was also an hunting ground for vampires, and nefandi and cainites had a deal on recycling dirty money for the Giovanni in exchange for their protection\u2026 will the mage get in touch with the vampires or fight them?)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Also the technocracy will keep an eye that neighborhood now. They know something is up but they still don't know exactly what.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Who knows how it will go on.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">But its a really awesome ride.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">So who say there can't be girl gamers and magic doesn't happen?!</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">it sure does <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","name":"Lasombra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T16:29:36-08:00","id":1008318,"title":"","content":"You know what you must do now? You need to slowly plant the idea of having one (or all) of them try out being a Story Teller.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T05:34:29-08:00","id":1008501,"title":"","content":"This wasn't magic. It was Statistical Inevitability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":